WEBVTT

NOTE Silent video. Cues are the on-screen step captions; the terminal text is in the transcript.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.867
A public page: The public page carries a title and nothing else. Its ticket and source file must not ship with it.

2
00:00:05.867 --> 00:00:15.933
The sidecar: A private manifest supplies source and jira per page. Two lines of config declare which keys it owns.

3
00:00:15.933 --> 00:00:26.500
validate sees one object: auth passes on the merged values. billing's bad ticket is reported at docs-meta.yaml:6, not in the page.

4
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:35.233
The page stays clean: query refuses to write a sidecar-owned key into the public file.

5
00:00:35.233 --> 00:00:40.833
Exit codes for CI: 1 for findings, 2 for the refusal. Nothing private reaches the public repo.

